<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<text>
<p>London, Dec 11 (reuter) -DB Capital Markets has issued 20 million standard and two million SCAN (Second Chance Assigned if Necessary) American-style call and put warrants. There are four tranches of standard warrants, five million each and two tranches of SCAN warrants, one million each, on Deutsche Telekom, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	  ISS PRICE</p>
<p> STANDARD</p>
<p> CALL A	  33.00 DEM     3.22 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	  36.00 DEM     2.13 DEM</p>
<p> PUT C	   30.00 DEM     2.07 DEM</p>
<p> PUT D	   33.00 DEM     3.53 DEM</p>
<p> SCAN</p>
<p> CALL	    33.00 DEM     4.00 DEM</p>
<p> PUT	     33.00 DEM     4.25 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 18.DEC.96-15.APR.98   PAYDATE	18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT DUESSELDORF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
